{
  "slug": "hipaalint-ai",
  "name": "Hipaalint Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Static analysis for potential HIPAA-related issues in AI-assisted development. Informational only; not legal advice or compliance certification.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `hipaa-compliance` (HIPAA compliance directives for AI-assisted development), `phi` (Detect Protected Health Information (PHI) in code files), `report` (Generate a HIPAA compliance audit report for a project), `rules` (List and search compliance rules in the HipaaLint database), `scan` (Scan a project directory for HIPAA compliance violations), `score` (Calculate the HipaaLint compliance score for a project)\n- **Agents** (1): `compliance-reviewer` (HIPAA compliance reviewer agent)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `hipaalint-ai`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hipaalint-ai@claude-community` from `shivyadavus/hipaalint`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
